#: src/administration/1.0_upgrade.md:1
msgid "1.0 Upgrade Instructions"
msgstr ""

#: src/administration/1.0_upgrade.md:3
msgid "Preparations"
msgstr ""

#: src/administration/1.0_upgrade.md:5
msgid ""
"Make sure you have working [backups](./backup_and_restore.md), and test that "
"they can be restored (e.g. to your local computer)"
msgstr ""

#: src/administration/1.0_upgrade.md:6
msgid ""
"Before upgrading the production server, you can test if the migration works "
"correctly and see how long it takes. For this take the backup from above and "
"load it into a test database. Then run the latest 1.0 release with that "
"database. If the test upgrade fails, open an issue."
msgstr ""

#: src/administration/1.0_upgrade.md:7
msgid ""
"On lemmy.ml the migrations take about 24 hours, during which the site will "
"be inaccessible. Post an announcement about the planned upgrade time and use "
"\"Feature in Local\" so that all users see it."
msgstr ""

#: src/administration/1.0_upgrade.md:9
msgid "Run the Upgrade"
msgstr ""

#: src/administration/1.0_upgrade.md:11
msgid ""
"If you run with multiple Lemmy backend processes as described in [horizontal "
"scaling](./horizontal_scaling.md), make sure only one is active while "
"running migrations."
msgstr ""

#: src/administration/1.0_upgrade.md:12
msgid ""
"Adjust [lemmy-ui environment variables](https://github.com/LemmyNet/lemmy-ui?"
"tab=readme-ov-file#configuration). The important ones are:"
msgstr ""

#: src/administration/1.0_upgrade.md:14
msgid ""
"```\n"
"- LEMMY_UI_BACKEND_INTERNAL=http://lemmy:8536\n"
"- LEMMY_UI_BACKEND=https://voyager.lemmy.ml\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: src/administration/1.0_upgrade.md:19
msgid ""
"Adjust [lemmy.hjson config variables](https://github.com/LemmyNet/lemmy/blob/"
"main/config/defaults.hjson)."
msgstr ""

#: src/administration/1.0_upgrade.md:20
msgid ""
"Instead of separate database fields `host`, `password` etc, there is a "
"single `connection` url"
msgstr ""

#: src/administration/1.0_upgrade.md:21
msgid "The email section also uses a `connection` url"
msgstr ""

#: src/administration/1.0_upgrade.md:22
msgid ""
"Upgrade version names in your `docker-compose.yml` file (eg replace "
"`dessalines/lemmy:0.19.XX` with `dessalines/lemmy:1.0.0-beta.1`)"
msgstr ""

#: src/administration/1.0_upgrade.md:23
msgid ""
"Wait for migrations to complete (this may take many hours as noted above)"
msgstr ""

#: src/administration/1.0_upgrade.md:24
msgid "Test that the site is working as expected"
msgstr ""
